<title>USA: Asia Pacific Wire postpones offering.</title>
<headline>Asia Pacific Wire postpones offering.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asia Pacific Wire &amp; Cable Corp Ltd said it has postponed its initial public offering of common stock due to market conditions.</p>
<p>Asia Pacific Wire is a leading manufacturer of wire and caqble products for the telecommunications and power industries in selected markets in the Asia Pacific Region.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
